{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"||*I know I am not yet redeemed. It would be arrogant to assume one foolish act could change a history. But I swear to the forces of light in this world I will do everything within my abilities to do good.*||","created_at":"2020-07-29T20:10:48.526000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738126404364795965","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
